<view class="page memory"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="nav"><view class="back" bindtap="back">‹</view><view class="nav-title">这次旅行的回忆</view><view bindtap="share">↗</view></view><view class="poster card"><view class="poster-head"><view class="eyebrow">TRIP MEMORY · 2026</view><view class="display">关西，<br/>盛夏七日</view><view class="subtle">{{trip.dateRange}}</view></view><view class="photo-frame poster-photo"><image class="photo-atlas tile-0" src="/assets/kansai-atlas.png" mode="scaleToFill"/></view><view class="stats-grid"><view><b>{{trip.photos}}</b><text>照片</text></view><view><b>{{trip.days}}</b><text>旅行天数</text></view><view><b>{{trip.cities}}</b><text>到访城市</text></view><view><b>{{trip.places}}</b><text>地点</text></view><view><b>{{trip.distance}}</b><text>总步行距离</text></view><view><b>18:32</b><text>最早拍摄</text></view></view><view class="memory-route"><view class="section-title">旅行足迹</view><view class="subtle">你走过 {{trip.cities}} 个城市、{{trip.places}} 个地方</view><view class="memory-photos"><view wx:for="{{events}}" wx:key="id" class="memory-place"><view class="photo-frame"><image class="photo-atlas tile-{{item.tile}}" src="/assets/kansai-atlas.png" mode="scaleToFill"/></view><text>{{item.title}}</text></view></view></view><view class="memory-story"><view class="section-title">旅行故事</view><text>{{trip.summary}} 再到神户与小鹿的相遇，这是一起被照片保留下来的关西夏日。</text></view><view class="signature">拾旅 · 让照片重新变成旅途</view></view><button class="primary share" bindtap="share">分享这段回忆</button></view>
